# Local PartyServer via wrangler (default port 8787). Override production default.
# Name is historical — this is PartyServer (workers.dev), not hosted PartyKit.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PARTYKIT_HOST=127.0.0.1:8787

# When unset, the app uses DEFAULT_PARTYKIT_HOST in src/lib/party.ts
# (production: beans-party.beans-lwagner.workers.dev).
# StaleClientGuard compares this host + NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA
# (injected by Vercel) against GET /api/version and reloads old PWAs.

# Server-only — never expose in the browser bundle
# Preferred AI judge (Gemini free-tier flash-lite first). Either name works:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=
# Optional free-tier Groq fallback (llama-3.1-8b-instant) after Gemini:
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# Shared secret so only PartyServer can call /api/judge for paid scoring
# (set the same value on the Worker with: npx wrangler secret put JUDGE_SECRET)
# JUDGE_SECRET=
# Optional absolute app URL for PartyServer → Next judge calls
# JUDGE_URL=https://beans-game.vercel.app
